# CityWatch — Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file and rename it to  .env  (no ".example" suffix)
#   2. Fill in the CW_JWT_SECRET value below
#   3. Never commit .env to Git (it's already in .gitignore)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# JWT signing secret — MUST be at least 32 characters (256 bits).
# Generate a strong one by running this in PowerShell:
#   [Convert]::ToBase64String((1..32 | ForEach-Object { [byte](Get-Random -Max 256) }))
#
# ► PASTE YOUR GENERATED SECRET BELOW (replace the placeholder):
CW_JWT_SECRET=REPLACE_THIS_WITH_YOUR_GENERATED_SECRET_MIN_32_CHARS
